CONSTRAINT ANALYSIS:
Two constraints: sum(c_k)=#SC and sum(k*c_k)=2^{free_bits}
At n≤5: only bl∈{1,3} active → DOF=0, unique solution!
At n≥6: bl∈{1,3,5,7,9} active → DOF=3, multiple solutions, structure selects one.

DOMINANT bl VALUE: bl=7 at n=6 and n=7 (33-36% of all SC classes).
The bl=7 dominance persists across n=6 and n=7.

