H=9,  |Aut|=9, #t=1: n≥6 (n=6,7,...)
H=15, |Aut|=5, #t=3: ODD n≥5 (n=5,7,...)
Pure-blue count: 2, 1, 3, 2, 4 for n=3..7 (growing slowly, alternating odd/even n)

KEY: All pure-blue classes have #tilings ≤ 3, forced by parity.

